  "description": "Drop-in replacement for System.Xml.Serialization.XmlSerializer backed by XmlSerDe's generated code: existing XmlSerializer call sites keep their shape and get the generated fast path instead. Measured on the same document (.NET 10), with every XML-conformance feature and guard turned on, as the facade does: about 3.3x faster deserialization on 5% of the allocations. A type the generator cannot serve falls back to the BCL serializer and keeps working; every refusal is reported at build time as diagnostic XMLSERDE001. Requires the XmlSerDe package.",
